4. the doors — path-shaped arguments refuse or stay inert data
  ok    spawn with a seat name pointing at B is refused (seat-name validation)
  ok    dispatch with a path-shaped seat name is refused
  ok    stop with a path-shaped seat name is refused
  ok    dispatch with a path-shaped BEAD ID is refused before it can be interpreted as a path
